<title>LUXEMBOURG: Luxembourg sells 670 mln Luxfr government bonds.</title>
<headline>Luxembourg sells 670 mln Luxfr government bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Luxembourg Treasury said the following were the results of its October monthly auction -</p>
<p>AUCTION RESULTS  MFLV  MFLW</p>
<p> Type of bond  linear  6.00 pct	 Due date 23/02/2006</p>
<p> Series nr 7				  Payment date 18/10</p>
<p>Amount auctioned 670 million francs</p>
<p>Average weighted yield 5.9 pct *</p>
<p>Average weighted auction price 100.549</p>
<p>NOTE - next auction on 20/11; * compares with 6.08 pct</p>
<p>market yield on Belgium's 2006 benchmark bond at 1125 GMT</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
